                                            any trust for the direct or indirect benefit of the undersigned or the immediate family of
                                            the undersigned (for purposes of this lock-up agreement, &ldquo;immediate family&rdquo; shall
                                            mean any relationship by blood, marriage or adoption, not more remote than first cousin);</FONT></TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
